==Notes==
This quest is repeatable
==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Junk or Bust]] in order to do [[Quest:Robot Woes]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Rizzle wants you to fix his Broken Robot Guards in Sunstone Valley.
*Fix Broken Robot Guards - /4
*Return to Rizzle
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"These robots keep breaking!<br />If I don't get them fixed soon, Willis will kick me out of here faster than you can spin!<br />The only problem is that I'm right in the middle of a nap, so... what do you say, pal! Want to <font color='#D9781A'>fix</font> up those <font color='#D9781A'>Broken Robot Guards</font> for me?" -Rizzle
#Fix Broken Robot Guards - /4
#*[[Broken Robot Guard]]s are located all around the outside of [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]]. Watch out for [[Robgoblin Junk Thief|Robgoblin Junk Thieves]]!
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Wow, <Player Name>, you fixed up those robots pretty fast!<br />Well, I guess I owe you something for all your hard work. Uh, let’s see what I’ve got here... Uh...<br />I’m sure I’ve got something here that’s worth something..." -Rizzle
